.TH FCNTL 3
.SH NAME
fcntl \- libc descriptor-control interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <fcntl.h>
.sp
.BI "int fcntl(int fd, int command, ...);"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The libc wrapper submits descriptor control to the native Astia file layer.
Use
.B F_DUPFD_CLOEXEC
when the duplicate must be close-on-exec from the instant it is installed;
the kernel performs the allocation and flag update atomically.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fcntl (2),
.BR dup (2)
